      en: 'He brought the criticism of narrators and biographical scholarship to its peak; the Siyar, Tarikh al-Islam, Tadhkirat al-Huffaz and Mizan al-I‘tidal remain core references for hadith scholars, and Kitab al-Uluww collects the statements of the Salaf on Allah’s exaltedness above His creation.',
